[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      6[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ## Mechanical derivation of the axes
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+      9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m ### Axis 1 — public entry points (the FULL set, incl. the lowest level)
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     10[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
