[1mOne real bug, in [38;5;10mprintHexCharLine[0m.[22m Called through a [38;5;10mvoid(*)(int)[0m pointer with [38;5;10mINT_MIN[0m, the C printed [38;5;10m00[0m and the Rust printed [38;5;10m80000000[0m. [38;5;10mobjdump[0m showed why:[0m[0m
[0m[0m
[38;5;10mC:    mov %edi,%eax ; mov %al,-0x4(%rbp) ; movsbl -0x4(%rbp),%eax   # trust only the low byte
